  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "はねの　おんどは　マイナス１８０ど。\nれいきを　こめた　りんぷんを　ゆきの\nように　ふりまき　のやまを　とぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "날개의 온도는 영하 180도.\n냉기가 담긴 인분을 눈처럼\n흩뿌리며 산과 들을 날아다닌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "翅膀的溫度是零下１８０度。\n當牠飛過山野時，帶有冷氣的\n鱗粉會像下雪般地飄落下來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La température de ses ailes est de - 180 °C.\nQuand il vole, ses écailles gelées tombent\nsur le paysage comme des flocons de neige.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine Flügel sind -180 ºC kalt. Während es über\nFelder und Berge fliegt, verstreut es mit Kälte\nversetzten Flügelstaub, der wie Schnee aussieht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La temperatura de sus alas es de -180 °C.\nSobrevuela el campo esparciendo sus gélidas\nescamas, como si de nieve se tratase.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La temperatura delle sue ali è di -180 ºC.\nSorvola pianure e montagne lasciando cadere le\nsue scaglie gelide come fossero fiocchi di neve.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Icy scales fall from its wings like snow as it flies\nover fields and mountains. The temperature of its\nwings is less than −290 degrees Fahrenheit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はねの　温度は　マイナス１８０度。\n冷気を　込めた　りんぷんを　雪の\nように　ふりまき　野山を　飛ぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "翅膀的温度为零下１８０度。\n当它飞过山野时，带有冷气的\n鳞粉会像下雪般地飘落下来。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La temperatura de sus alas es de -180 °C.\nSobrevuela el campo esparciendo sus gélidas\nescamas, como si de nieve se tratase.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "のやまを　あらすものには　ようしゃ\nしない。　つめたいはねで　とびまわり\nふぶきを　おこして　こらしめる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "산과 들을 황폐하게 만들면 용서하지 않는다.\n차가운 날개로 날아다니며\n눈보라를 일으켜 응징한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "絕不放過破壞山野環境的人。\n會用冰冷的翅膀四處飛翔，\n製造出暴風雪來懲罰他們。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sans pitié pour les vandales, il bat ses ailes\ngelées pour provoquer des blizzards et punir\nquiconque ose souiller les champs et les collines.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Verwüstet jemand Felder und Berge, vergibt es\nihm niemals. Es bestraft den Täter, indem es mit\nseinen kalten Flügeln einen Schneesturm erzeugt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No muestra la menor compasión con quien asole\nel campo: lo escarmienta batiendo sus gélidas\nalas para provocar una ventisca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Non ha alcuna pietà per chi danneggia la natura.\nVola in ricognizione e punisce i malfattori con\ntempeste di neve che crea con le sue fredde ali.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields\nand mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings,\ncausing a blizzard to chase offenders away.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "野山を　荒らすものには　容赦\nしない。　冷たいはねで　飛びまわり\n吹雪を　起こして　懲らしめる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "绝不放过破坏山野环境的人。\n会用冰冷的翅膀四处飞翔，\n制造出暴风雪来惩罚他们。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No muestra la menor compasión con quien asole\nel campo: lo escarmienta batiendo sus gélidas\nalas para provocar una ventisca.",
      "language": {
